lse, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2454538, "client_id": 1146884, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/6545cd41/uploads/origins/24a205fc-f992-4e04-b0e3-4fd4394e8305?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ee0beea4f696b2838b9cec28cf54f9b8", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6545cd41/uploads/origins/24a205fc-f992-4e04-b0e3-4fd4394e8305?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ee0beea4f696b2838b9cec28cf54f9b8, https://si.imgix.net/6545cd41/uploads/origins/24a205fc-f992-4e04-b0e3-4fd4394e8305?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2a1ddab02d7b0abe834b8026206ddb58 2x, https://si.imgix.net/6545cd41/uploads/origins/24a205fc-f992-4e04-b0e3-4fd4394e8305?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=eb64881c5a40886282f71be466307602 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/6545cd41/uploads/origins/24a205fc-f992-4e04-b0e3-4fd4394e8305?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a69d97bd3467c1235afc6c327600d00a", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6545cd41/uploads/origins/24a205fc-f992-4e04-b0e3-4fd4394e8305?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a69d97bd3467c1235afc6c327600d00a, https://si.imgix.net/6545cd41/uploads/origins/24a205fc-f992-4e04-b0e3-4fd4394e8305?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a9cd9b0d2422c062e3ad0b4314695a3f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/6545cd41/uploads/origins/24a205fc-f992-4e04-b0e3-4fd4394e8305?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=196eb6741ebed15ee1432a7696ed875c 3x"}, "body": "Hello! I really liked the drawing you did of me and my partner's characters, CARABELLE and IRENE!\nhttps://skeb.jp/@UIIU04/works/6\nIt's my favorite picture of them and I am so grateful! If possible, could I ask you to draw our other characters? Please feel free to reject or raise the price, since five characters is a lot!\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/QF98bZj\n\nThey are a group of college students in a fantasy-like setting.\n- JAIME (172cm) is the green character. She is friendly, fashionable, and popular.\n- CELEUXE (165cm) is the red character. He is hot-headed, reckless, and likes to act like the leader.\n- YUMENO (157cm) is the pink character. She still acts like a 中二病, but is nervous in public.\n- DIOE (152cm) is the yellow character. They dislike talking, but try to be polite.\n- LISZA (170cm) is the blue character. She is awkward around others, but can be playful when she feels comfortable.\n\nAll five of them are very close. Please draw however you'd like! Thank you for your consideration!", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@UIIU04/works/8", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2454538, "client_id": 350566, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2c79f4e4/uploads/origins/9796a453-5672-4571-884b-f598f0cf391c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fb2f8146e2659cde1204a66829c979cc", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2c79f4e4/uploads/origins/9796a453-5672-4571-884b-f598f0cf391c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fb2f8146e2659cde1204a66829c979cc, https://si.imgix.net/2c79f4e4/uploads/origins/9796a453-5672-4571-884b-f598f0cf391c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9c0f1f623814e10e315e5849ff5704d6 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2c79f4e4/uploads/origins/9796a453-5672-4571-884b-f598f0cf391c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d2eb29ca33e68c7613badc43282efb56 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2c79f4e4/uploads/origins/9796a453-5672-4571-884b-f598f0cf391c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5b75b6d3136052074cbf8a8baeedbab3", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2c79f4e4/uploads/origins/9796a453-5672-4571-884b-f598f0cf391c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5b75b6d3136052074cbf8a8baeedbab3, https://si.imgix.net/2c79f4e4/uploads/origins/9796a453-5672-4571-884b-f598f0cf391c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5228b97f307c808950bbab334f1cb214 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2c79f4e4/uploads/origins/9796a453-5672-4571-884b-f598f0cf391c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=85737b3af346f0254897c4fb8b53984e 3x"}, "body": "UI様、はじめまして！イラストを楽しく拝見させて頂きました。素敵な絵柄に惹かれて、可能ならば自キャラを依頼したいと思っております。\n\n【依頼内容】\nキャラ参照は下記のURLをご覧ください。南東アジアの様なトロピカル島国に旅をしていて、凸凹コンビで喧嘩すればするほど仲がいい、親友家族恋人相棒のお2人です。一緒に未知か禁じられた廃墟や遺跡を探索している、所謂トゥームレイダーの様な存在です。褐色肌の子は楽天家でお喋り、髪の内側は宇宙の様に光っている。黒髪の子は不器用でクールな性格。対照的な2人ですが、一蓮托生の仲です。\n\n【テーマ】\n・可能ならば、2人をこちらの衣装を着せてください：https://sta.sh/2cqz4wti4y7\n➤ 青い鞄と紫のショールが付いている方をお願い致します。黒髪の子の髪は右に流している。\n➤ このURL先のモチーフや小物を入れても大丈夫です：https://sta.sh/23auuzaquab\n\n・カラフルで可愛くて、楽しい雰囲気の一枚をお願い致します。\n・「夏、お菓子とお茶、モザイクタイル、ヴィンテージ切手、骨董品、太陽と月、民族風」のモチーフをどちらでもご自由に使って大丈夫です。\n・ポーズや構図は他は何でも構いませんので、お気軽に描いてください！\n\n依頼内容に何か難しい点か問題点があれば、お気になさらずこの依頼をキャンセルしてください。ご検討のほど、何卒よろしくお願いします。\n\nhttps://sta.sh/2cqz4wti4y7", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@UIIU04/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2454538, "client_id": 173, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0d3c4054/uploads/origins/48f9927e-9d75-48d6-996c-7311a44abfae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=958d6c5eea4a99d8d08ad9f6937778e5", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0d3c4054/uploads/origins/48f9927e-9d75-48d6-996c-7311a44abfae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=958d6c5eea4a99d8d08ad9f6937778e5, https://si.imgix.net/0d3c4054/uploads/origins/48f9927e-9d75-48d6-996c-7311a44abfae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9b0313d9dd6558e25c548cc582357887 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0d3c4054/uploads/origins/48f9927e-9d75-48d6-996c-7311a44abfae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b790bde41dbbf8bfde1b7b8e2be9306a 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0d3c4054/uploads/origins/48f9927e-9d75-48d6-996c-7311a44abfae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=579a1379abccadaab8a576beff500164", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0d3c4054/uploads/origins/48f9927e-9d75-48d6-996c-7311a44abfae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=579a1379abccadaab8a576beff500164, https://si.imgix.net/0d3c4054/uploads/origins/48f9927e-9d75-48d6-996c-7311a44abfae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=87684a3a4e731c1a6c97feedb0574317 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0d3c4054/uploads/origins/48f9927e-9d75-48d6-996c-7311a44abfae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=aca6fb6596e1646aa5d0dfb666395a0d 3x"}, "body": "HELLO!\n😍Your art is incredible!\nThe colors are so pretty! Everything is so fun! \nYour art makes me so happy!🥰\nI would be so happy if I can request a picture!\n\nCan you please draw my character?\n🖤His name is クロニ\n\nHe is an oni!\nOnce a superhero who fought evil!\nHowever, they were devoured & eaten alive by ヤマタノオロチ.\nHundreds of years later he escaped. The incident was so traumatic it changed him.\nFilled with anger & sorrow, he is now a supervillain!\nHe has many scars now. Tail & one horn damaged too.\n\nHe is also a Visual-Kei musician.🎤\nHe channels his hatred & need for revenge into music.\nThe concerts have a horror theme to them! Channeling the forces of hell into his musical theater!\nA love for gothic & dark imagery!💀🥀\nWhen he isn't performing a concert, he tends to be brooding & melancholic.\n\nHe has different outfits. You can choose the one you want to draw! Or design one for him.\nThe pose, expression, & everything I leave up to you!\nI hope you can have fun with it!😄\n\nThank you!🌹\n\nhttps://catbox.moe/c/k6soi6", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@UIIU04/works/6", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2454538, "client_id": 2413119, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/67629a83/uploads/origins/a6250776-70ad-4a09-a5e8-97afa6f1a668?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9d94f0d0dc18d316fd7913a87ab1dc68", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/67629a83/uploads/origins/a6250776-70ad-4a09-a5e8-97afa6f1a668?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9d94f0d0dc18d316fd7913a87ab1dc68, https://si.imgix.net/67629a83/uploads/origins/a6250776-70ad-4a09-a5e8-97afa6f1a668?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a326e5e796a8531b234bcdd9dffa1049 2x, https://si.imgix.net/67629a83/uploads/origins/a6250776-70ad-4a09-a5e8-97afa6f1a668?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9b0f9964fbf6d459b817f09825bee813 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/67629a83/uploads/origins/a6250776-70ad-4a09-a5e8-97afa6f1a668?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b26c2fc2bccb4d919f31aa5858908bab", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/67629a83/uploads/origins/a6250776-70ad-4a09-a5e8-97afa6f1a668?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b26c2fc2bccb4d919f31aa5858908bab, https://si.imgix.net/67629a83/uploads/origins/a6250776-70ad-4a09-a5e8-97afa6f1a668?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=8fbd24bfb984263a0faed002c0c9eed2 2x, https://si.imgix.net/67629a83/uploads/origins/a6250776-70ad-4a09-a5e8-97afa6f1a668?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=656b352d987efa7d814a54494f443050 3x"}, "body": "Hello! Your art style is so pretty! Would it be possible for me to request these two characters to be drawn together?\n\nCARABELLE is on the left. She is very sociable and stylish, always being recognized because she is a popular fashion designer. She is often tipsy because she drinks alcohol in order to get inspiration.\n\nIRENE is on the right. She is more serious and strict. She worked as a child actor and now dislikes a lot of the attention. Still, when she's around some of her closer friends (like CARABELLE), she lets herself smile and be a little lighter.\n\nThe two of them are close partners both on and off of work. They run the public relations division for their company. They can be drawn with alcohol, ice cream, coffee, or with newspapers and reports. These are just suggestions, please draw them however you would like! Thank you for your consideration!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1YveyxZwQS9v9p5zU_58UzX8RMOiVv1TO/view?usp=sharing", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@UIIU04/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2454538, "client_id": 3116091, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/4e297374/uploads/origins/0d533bea-ab74-4fe9-9d83-b9ffe8fea389?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a3f7e2c6b39de67472ce5c53e196e9a3", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4e297374/uploads/origins/0d533bea-ab74-4fe9-9d83-b9ffe8fea389?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a3f7e2c6b39de67472ce5c53e196e9a3, https://si.imgix.net/4e297374/uploads/origins/0d533bea-ab74-4fe9-9d83-b9ffe8fea389?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3ac75c48985523fe90e88b06de330e56 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4e297374/uploads/origins/0d533bea-ab74-4fe9-9d83-b9ffe8fea389?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c45abe02aa9d00ed309ec9ec75e82dd3 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/4e297374/uploads/origins/0d533bea-ab74-4fe9-9d83-b9ffe8fea389?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4d84222dcfb862fdf16d04647f2b56f7", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4e297374/uploads/origins/0d533bea-ab74-4fe9-9d83-b9ffe8fea389?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4d84222dcfb862fdf16d04647f2b56f7, https://si.imgix.net/4e297374/uploads/origins/0d533bea-ab74-4fe9-9d83-b9ffe8fea389?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3c3ead3cd7b8f262a20723c533a621fd 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4e297374/uploads/origins/0d533bea-ab74-4fe9-9d83-b9ffe8fea389?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=34eb7bb3749f84bf5abc51f7c5708a6d 3x"}, "body": "Hello again! I really liked the previous art I got from you (https://skeb.jp/@UIIU04/works/2)\nso I'm looking to request another.\n\nI would like one with the same character, but this time in his winter attire.\nHe's 13 years old and tries his best to look cool but is a bit of a \"tsundere\" who gets flustered easily.\nSince he's in his winter attire, I t